  "title": "Blast radius terrain · PR 131",
  "headings": [
    {
      "tag": "H1",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The limits moved.\nThe mechanisms stayed.",
      "y": 133
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Output massif",
      "y": 449
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "SUMMIT → READER → EXACT ACCESS",
      "y": 783
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "CROSS TO A SHARED READER",
      "y": 1073
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "MECHANISM & REASON RECEIPTS",
      "y": 1237
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Seven regions. A test shore.\nFive faults to keep in sight.",
      "y": 1230
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "One capacity vocabulary reaches seven source readers.",
      "y": 1398
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Coordination clocks move; healthy warm-up stays unbounded.",
      "y": 1525
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A shared section keeps several distinct clocks.",
      "y": 1653
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Memory thresholds stop being derived twice.",
      "y": 1780
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Log limits and disconnected traces share an owner.",
      "y": 1908
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "One direct reader serves different timeout purposes.",
      "y": 2035
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A reattached execute gets a fresh fetch allowance.",
      "y": 2162
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Small test knobs cross a test-only boundary.",
      "y": 2290
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A later completion error can replace the first error.",
      "y": 2417
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The adapter changes the test input, not just its address.",
      "y": 2544
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The old memory-derivation block disappears.",
      "y": 2691
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Expected values change source; three fixtures bypass typing.",
      "y": 2818
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "An invalid snapshot can now fail before a worker exists.",
      "y": 2965
    },
    {
